                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Date range</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>1 January 2021 to 31 December 2025 (five full years of daily trading data).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Prices</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Prices are adjusted for stock splits and dividends, so the history is comparable over time.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>KPI definitions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Total Return: the percentage change in price from the first to the last trading day of the period.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- CAGR: the steady yearly growth rate that would turn the starting price into the ending price.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
