                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Growth of 100: each price divided by its first-day price and multiplied by 100, so the lines start at the same point.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Drawdown from peak: how far each day&apos;s price sits below its highest previous close.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Disclaimer</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>This is a personal data project for learning and portfolio purposes. It is not financial advice, and past performance does not predict future results.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
